/P 85 0 R
/E (The Job Data Pipeline project is designed to automate the collection and processing of technology job market data in Saudi Arabia from multiple sources. The pipeline will transform raw technology job postings into a structured and analysis-ready dataset by applying data cleaning, standardization, translation, and integration processes.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
