182 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The project relies on five selected sources to ensure comprehensive coverage of the technology job market in Saudi Arabia.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
183 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The sources represent different connectivity types:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 582 0 R
/E (Jooble API: Official API source. Connectivity is established via HTTPS POST request to https://jooble.org/api/{API_KEY} with a JSON body containing keywords and location. Authentication is via API key.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 583 0 R
/E (JSearch API \(RapidAPI\): Managed REST API source. Connectivity is via HTTPS GET request to the RapidAPI gateway. Authentication requires X-RapidAPI-Key and X-RapidAPI-Host headers. Pagination is cursor-based, using a next_page_cursor value returned with each response to retrieve subsequent pages.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
186 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 584 0 R
/E (FreeHire API: Browser-simulated API source. Connectivity is via HTTPS GET request to an internal search endpoint \(https://freehire.me/api/v1/jobs/search\), authenticated implicitly through browser-context headers \(User-Agent, Referer\) rather than an API key. Pagination is handled via limit and offset parameters. This source natively supports technology-job filtering through an is_tech parameter.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
187 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 585 0 R
/E (TapNeo Dataset: File-based source. Connectivity is via direct file download in CSV/JSON format. It serves as a historical baseline and does not require continuous API connectivity.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
188 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 586 0 R
/E (Tanqeeb Aggregator: Web-based source with no official API. Connectivity is via web scraping, routed through the ScrapeOps Proxy API to bypass the source's bot-detection protections. HTML content is parsed using Python libraries once retrieved.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
