202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (Given the heterogeneity of the five data sources, each requiring a distinct connectivity mechanism, the pipeline was designed around a unified batch-ingestion strategy rather than real-time streaming. This section outlines the connectivity patterns, pagination handling, and resilience mechanisms applied across all sources.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 89 0 R
/T (1. Connectivity Patterns)
/E (1. Connectivity Patterns)
