241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (Given that most sources enforce request quotas \(e.g., Jooble's monthly limit, RapidAPI's per-second and per-month limits\), the ingestion logic incorporates the following safeguards:)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
242 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 628 0 R
/E (HTTP 429 Too Many Requests responses trigger a short backoff delay followed by a single retry attempt.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
243 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 629 0 R
/E (Keyword and location combinations are deliberately scoped and estimated before execution, allowing the total projected request count to be validated against the remaining quota prior to a full run.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 630 0 R
/E (A short inter-request delay is applied between paginated calls to avoid triggering aggressive rate limits.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
