247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 631 0 R
/E (HTTP status codes are checked explicitly; non-200 responses are logged with the failing query and response body for diagnosis, rather than causing a silent failure or full pipeline crash.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
