/T (The proposed Implementation Plan is designed to collect job postings from multiple sources and transform fragmented raw data into a standardized, validated, and structured dataset. The architecture separates raw data storage from data processing and final storage to preserve the original records while allowing the processed data to be continuously updated.)
/E (The proposed Implementation Plan is designed to collect job postings from multiple sources and transform fragmented raw data into a standardized, validated, and structured dataset. The architecture separates raw data storage from data processing and final storage to preserve the original records while allowing the processed data to be continuously updated.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
