/E (The automation layer will not be limited to data extraction. Instead, it will trigger the complete workflow, including data collection, raw data storage, transformation and cleaning, deduplication, data-quality validation, and loading of the final curated dataset into Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
