404 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 739 0 R
/E (Unified Data Pipeline: A modular, source-agnostic ingestion pipeline capable of extracting technology job postings from five heterogeneous sources \(Jooble, JSearch, FreeHire, TapNeo, Tanqeeb\), each handled through its appropriate connectivity method \(API, browser-simulated request, proxy-mediated scraping, or static file retrieval\).)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 740 0 R
/E (Layered Data Lake Structure: A structured Bronze-Silver-Gold storage architecture within Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2, ensuring raw data traceability \(Bronze\), standardized and deduplicated records \(Silver\), and analysis-ready datasets \(Gold\) in CSV/Parquet format.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
406 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 741 0 R
/E (Standardized Job Schema: A unified data model that normalizes inconsistent fields across sources \(e.g., job title, company, location, posting date\) into a single, queryable schema, resolving source-specific formatting differences.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
407 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 742 0 R
/E (Deduplication and Data Quality Logic: Automated fuzzy-matching deduplication \(via Rapidfuzz\) and geographic validation logic to eliminate duplicate postings and filter out mislocated or non-Saudi entries with misleading location matches.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 743 0 R
/E (Reusable Extraction Modules: Independently testable Python modules per source, allowing new data sources to be onboarded without modifying the core pipeline logic.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
